{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/adhara-star-acube-arjan","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":737,"crm_id":"480","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Adhara Star","slug":"adhara-star-acube-arjan","display_address":"Arjan","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2025","developer":"Acube Developers","price":1349250,"display_price":"1.34M","lattitude":25.065763,"longitude":55.2318731,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>Adhara Star by Acube Real Estate Development is an elegant 17-storey wonder that will grace the vibrant neighborhood of Arjan Dubai. Adhara Star offers a striking collection of <strong>one, two and three bedroom apartments</strong> to suit a variety of requirements. Acube Real Estate Development, known for its commitment to quality and innovation, is the promoter of this up-and-coming project.</p><p>The impressive Adhara Star at Arjan, comprising 115 thoughtfully designed apartments including retail spaces, promises a harmonious blend of luxury and functionality. The project is dedicated to the celestial star Adhara, located in the constellation Canis Major and known for its extraordinary brightness, 22 300 times the brightness of our sun.</p><p>Designed with meticulous attention to detail, the Adhara Star apartments will feature exquisite porcelain and ceramic tiles, showcasing the epitome of sophisticated living. The kitchen area will be equipped with premium Italian fittings, complemented by European sanitary ware and appliances to make everyday life more comfortable. For the convenience of the residents, three levels of the podium have been allotted for secure parking.</p><p>Notably, Adhara Star is in line with the principles of Vastu, reflecting a harmonious living environment. Going beyond mere living, it is a constellation of luxury, artistic grace and unrivaled comfort, offering an extraordinary living experience in the heart of Dubai.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/480/images/2023/10/05/rYkSZ0OLFe9XFaAnqTk1oDrOOznXlTizfYqzJfMP.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/10/05/rYkSZ0OLFe9XFaAnqTk1oDrOOznXlTizfYqzJfMP.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/480/images/2023/10/05/1H0CmC8f5ByvasIUvmrlIKM3XE11BnjviOfF27Ju.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/10/05/1H0CmC8f5ByvasIUvmrlIKM3XE11BnjviOfF27Ju.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/480/images/2023/10/05/B6DxkMA9W71RzHrUEMBw58W8VBHpjRLvqvNJHrqg.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/10/05/B6DxkMA9W71RzHrUEMBw58W8VBHpjRLvqvNJHrqg.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/480/images/2023/10/05/gdqliyGUmBSkWzyThobwsSznyqzcTYecTzreWhc8.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/10/05/gdqliyGUmBSkWzyThobwsSznyqzcTYecTzreWhc8.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/480/images/2023/10/05/N1f1mi8q9mvetJkK435zWgjUpswQe7WpfX4gc3cP.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/10/05/N1f1mi8q9mvetJkK435zWgjUpswQe7WpfX4gc3cP.jpg","__ggfxIndex":4},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/480/images/2023/10/05/PjFxDLN3wspZjfzSb7QSe7lnAfEsq0kAvVf2F1uU.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/10/05/PjFxDLN3wspZjfzSb7QSe7lnAfEsq0kAvVf2F1uU.jpg","__ggfxIndex":5},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/480/images/2023/10/05/cMsvta0SebacaOKRG0oahnKPAUoPisaOCE0Tcs66.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/10/05/cMsvta0SebacaOKRG0oahnKPAUoPisaOCE0Tcs66.jpg","__ggfxIndex":6}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":